msgstr "matrix 側は「どのテストが根拠か」を示し、"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:77
#: 17300003d66743b0a2533c55ebb8fb02
msgid ""
"and the notes clarify when optional dependencies can cause skips instead of hard "
"failures."
msgstr "備考が optional dependency や skip 条件を補います。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:75
msgid "Interpreting Automated Test Evidence"
msgstr "自動テストの根拠を読む"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:77
msgid ""
"The public sources above are the current entry points for automated test and "
"documentation-build evidence. Read them conservatively:"
msgstr "上記の公開資料は、自動テストとドキュメントビルドの根拠を確認するための現在の入口です。慎重に読み取ってください。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:80
msgid "they help identify which workflow or test suite covers a specific public claim,"
msgstr "特定の公開上の主張を、どの workflow またはテストスイートが扱うかを確認できます。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:86
#: b77ab4c5fb054dc4b31c31fa86ce025f
msgid ""
"it does **not** prove that every algorithm branch, notebook, or optional-backend path"
" is equally exercised,"
msgstr "一方で、すべてのアルゴリズム分岐、すべての notebook、すべての optional-backend 経路が同じ強さで実行されていることまでは保証しません。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:87
#: ddd4c0a14cae4a18ad693ac524104cd1
msgid ""
"and it should be read alongside page-specific evidence such as the notebook policy, "
"I/O matrix, and audit notes."
msgstr "実際の判断では、Notebook Policy、I/O matrix、アルゴリズム監査ノートと併読してください。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:89
#: e6323e436cb345bd8436cff602fbfca9
msgid "What This Page Does Not Claim"
msgstr "このページが主張しないこと"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:91
#: a1b7204762ba444cb29f4d2bc87789f0
msgid "It does **not** claim that every public notebook is fully executed in every CI run."
msgstr "すべての公開 notebook が、すべての CI 実行で全セル再実行されるとは主張しません。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:92
#: 9dddde4cb29941eb86d5e44c16a3f287
msgid ""
"It does **not** claim that every docstring example or sample code block is executed "
"in every PR, nightly, and release workflow."
msgstr "すべての docstring 例やサンプルコード片が、すべての PR / Nightly / release workflow で毎回実行されるとは主張しません。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:93
#: a71c7854852c42909028e84286c8b3c9
msgid ""
"It does **not** claim that every optional dependency is present in every test "
"environment."
msgstr "すべての optional dependency が、すべての test 環境に入っているとは主張しません。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:94
#: e72ff08448fa45348d870562a0f7a56f
